<title>USA: Hughes Training gets $338 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Hughes Training gets $338 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Training Inc of Arlington, Texas, a unit of Hughes Electronics Corp, has been awarded a $338 million U.S. defense contract for maintenance and training devices in support of the sale of F-16 fighter jets to South Korea, the Air Force said.</p>
<p>Work on the contract is expected to be completed by September of the year 2001.</p>
</text>
